，欲弒之。惠王從者屈固負王亡走昭王夫人宮。白公自立爲王。月餘，會葉公來救楚，楚惠王之徒與共攻白公，殺之。惠王乃復位。是歳也，滅陳而縣之。","source_term":"太子建之子勝"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji040-057","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"q8m_d0c_kq3_AEB"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-042","chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-042-zheng:m048-0008","c-shiji-042-zheng:m049-0000","c-shiji-042-zheng:m053-0005","c-shiji-042-zheng:m054-0012"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-042-zheng:p048","c-shiji-042-zheng:p049","c-shiji-042-zheng:p053","c-shiji-042-zheng:p054"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":4},{"source_id":"table-witness-shiji-015","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-015","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-015","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["shiji-015-r014-c04-m000"],"paragraph_ids":[],"table_cell_ids":["shiji-015-r014-c04"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-042-zheng"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji042-040","subject_person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AAAAA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AAAA","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p048","quote":"獻公十三年卒，子聲公勝立。當是時，晉六卿彊，侵奪鄭，鄭遂弱。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"獻公十三年卒，子聲公勝立","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依明示子、少子及弟保存來源主張，繼位不獨作父子，如兄弟不作血親；不補母名、年代或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji042-042","subject_person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AAAAAA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"gts_42q_flu_AAAAA","status":"source_attested","eviden